    "description": "Production-grade Postman collection for Nexus Learning Management System (LMS).\n\nIncludes complete request definitions for:\n1. Authentication & Session Management\n2. Department Administration & Faculty Governance (Multi-Department Assignment Flow)\n3. Subjective Ans Sheet Upload & Evaluation Surveillance\n4. Teacher Studio, Course Authoring & Analytics (Class Isolation)\n5. Student Learning Portal & 360\u00b0 Profile Portfolio\n6. Live Interactive Classes & In-Stream Doubt Engine\n7. 1-on-1 Faculty Mentorship Booking Engine\n8. Mylo AI (Google Gemini) Quiz Generation & Insights\n9. Enterprise PowerBI & Tabular Reporting APIs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
